#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:589
msgid "Diagonal = correct classifications"
msgstr "대각선 = 올바른 분류"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:590
msgid "Off-diagonal = misclassifications"
msgstr "비대각선 = 오분류"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:592
msgid "**Discriminant Function**: Statistical details"
msgstr "**판별 함수**: 통계적 세부사항"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:594
msgid "Wilks' Lambda: Smaller = better separation (0-1 scale)"
msgstr "Wilks' Lambda: 작을수록 더 나은 분리 (0-1 척도)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:595
