#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:597
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:648
msgid "**Example**:"
msgstr "**예제**:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:618
msgid "MANOVA"
msgstr "MANOVA"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:620
msgid "**Purpose**: Test if groups differ significantly in shape"
msgstr "**목적**: 그룹이 형태에서 유의하게 다른지 검정"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:624
msgid "Formal hypothesis testing"
msgstr "공식적인 가설 검정"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:625
msgid "Comparing multiple groups simultaneously"
msgstr "여러 그룹을 동시에 비교"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:626
msgid "Assessing effect size"
msgstr "효과 크기 평가"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:628
msgid ""
"**Running MANOVA**: MANOVA is computed as part of every analysis run. In the"
" analysis dialog, set the **MANOVA grouping variable** to the categorical "
"variable you want to test."
msgstr ""
"**MANOVA 실행**: MANOVA는 모든 분석 실행의 일부로 계산됩니다. 분석 대화상자에서 **MANOVA 그룹화 변수** 를 "
"검정하려는 범주형 변수로 지정합니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:634
msgid "**Wilks' Lambda**: Test statistic (0-1)"
msgstr "**Wilks' Lambda**: 검정 통계량 (0-1)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:636
msgid "Smaller = more group separation"
msgstr "작을수록 = 더 많은 그룹 분리"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:637
msgid "0 = perfect separation"
msgstr "0 = 완벽한 분리"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:638
msgid "1 = no separation"
msgstr "1 = 분리 없음"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:640
msgid "**F-statistic**: Ratio of between-group to within-group variation"
msgstr "**F-통계량**: 그룹 간 변이 대 그룹 내 변이의 비율"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:641
msgid "**P-value**: Probability that group differences are due to chance"
msgstr "**P-값**: 그룹 차이가 우연으로 인한 것일 확률"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:643
msgid "P < 0.05: Significant difference (reject null hypothesis)"
msgstr "P < 0.05: 유의한 차이 (귀무가설 기각)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:644
msgid "P ≥ 0.05: No significant difference"
msgstr "P ≥ 0.05: 유의한 차이 없음"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:646
msgid ""
"**Effect Size (Partial η²)**: Proportion of variance explained by groups"
msgstr "**효과 크기 (부분 η²)**: 그룹에 의해 설명되는 분산의 비율"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:666
msgid "Handling Missing Landmarks"
msgstr "결측 랜드마크 처리"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:668
msgid ""
"Modan2 fills in missing landmarks automatically during analysis, using an "
"EM-style refinement loop that interleaves alignment and imputation:"
msgstr ""
"Modan2는 분석 중에 결측 랜드마크를 자동으로 채웁니다. 정렬과 대치를 번갈아 수행하는 EM 방식의 반복 정밀화 루프를 사용합니다:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:671
msgid ""
"Align all specimens, leaving missing landmarks as gaps (the mean shape is "
"computed ignoring the gaps, and each specimen is aligned on the landmarks it"
" actually has)."
msgstr ""
"결측 랜드마크를 빈 자리로 남긴 채 모든 표본을 정렬합니다(평균 형상은 빈 자리를 무시하고 계산하며, 각 표본은 실제로 가지고 있는 "
"랜드마크만으로 정렬합니다)."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:674
msgid ""
"For each specimen with missing data, fit the current mean shape onto its "
"observed landmarks by a similarity transform (rotation, scale, and "
"translation) and read the missing positions off the fitted mean."
msgstr ""
"결측이 있는 각 표본에 대해, 현재 평균 형상을 그 표본의 관측된 랜드마크에 상사변환(회전, 크기, 이동)으로 정합한 뒤, 정합된 평균 "
"형상에서 결측 위치를 읽어옵니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:677
msgid ""
"Re-align with the filled-in values, then **re-open the original gaps** and "
"re-estimate them from the improved mean."
msgstr "채워 넣은 값으로 다시 정렬한 다음, **원래의 빈 자리를 다시 열어** 개선된 평균 형상으로부터 재추정합니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:679
msgid ""
"Repeat step 3 a small number of times so estimates keep improving as the "
"alignment settles (they are never fitted on previous estimates)."
msgstr ""
"3단계를 몇 번 반복하여, 정렬이 수렴해 가면서 추정값이 계속 개선되도록 합니다(이전 추정값에 다시 맞추는 일은 결코 없습니다)."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:682
msgid ""
"Imputed values live only in the analysis working copy — they are never "
"written back to the database. PCA, CVA, and MANOVA then run on the aligned "
"coordinates."
msgstr ""
"대치된 값은 분석용 작업 사본에만 존재하며 데이터베이스에 다시 기록되지 않습니다. 이후 PCA, CVA, MANOVA가 정렬된 좌표를 "
"대상으로 수행됩니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:686
msgid ""
"This is the same shape-fitting method used by the \"Show Estimated\" and "
"\"Show Expected\" previews in the Object Dialog. On synthetic test shapes "
"where the true answer is known, its error is essentially zero."
msgstr ""
"이는 객체 대화상자의 \"추정값 보기\"(Show Estimated)와 \"Show Expected\" 미리보기에 쓰이는 것과 동일한 "
"형상 정합 방법입니다. 정답을 알고 있는 합성 시험 형상에서는 오차가 사실상 0입니다."

