msgid "Data Organization"
msgstr "데이터 구성"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:856
msgid ""
"**Use consistent naming**: ``species_ID_number.jpg`` (e.g., "
"``sparrow_001.jpg``)"
msgstr "**일관된 이름 사용**: ``species_ID_number.jpg`` (예: ``sparrow_001.jpg``)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:857
msgid "**Organize hierarchically**: Group related datasets"
msgstr "**계층적으로 구성**: 관련 데이터셋 그룹화"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:858
msgid "**Document metadata**: Use description fields"
msgstr "**메타데이터 문서화**: 설명 필드 사용"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:859
msgid ""
"**Back up regularly**: export datasets as JSON+ZIP packages, or copy "
"``~/PaleoBytes/Modan2/`` while Modan2 is closed"
msgstr ""
"**정기적으로 백업하세요**: 데이터셋을 JSON+ZIP 패키지로 내보내거나, Modan2를 종료한 상태에서 "
"``~/PaleoBytes/Modan2/`` 를 복사하세요"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:863
msgid "Landmark Placement"
msgstr "랜드마크 배치"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:865
msgid "**Define landmarks carefully**: Use anatomically meaningful points"
msgstr "**랜드마크를 신중하게 정의**: 해부학적으로 의미 있는 점 사용"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:866
msgid "**Be consistent**: Same landmarks across all specimens"
msgstr "**일관성 유지**: 모든 표본에 동일한 랜드마크"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:867
msgid "**Use high-resolution images**: Better precision"
msgstr "**고해상도 이미지 사용**: 더 나은 정밀도"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:868
msgid "**Avoid ambiguous points**: Choose clear, repeatable features"
msgstr "**모호한 점 피하기**: 명확하고 반복 가능한 특징 선택"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:869
msgid "**Document landmarks**: Write down definitions (e.g., \"tip of beak\")"
msgstr "**랜드마크 문서화**: 정의를 기록 (예: \"부리 끝\")"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:874
msgid "**Check assumptions**: Normal distribution, homogeneity of variance"
msgstr "**가정 확인**: 정규 분포, 분산의 동질성"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:875
msgid "**Sample size**: At least 30 specimens for PCA, 10+ per group for CVA"
msgstr "**표본 크기**: PCA는 최소 30개 표본, CVA는 그룹당 10개 이상"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:876
msgid "**Validate results**: Cross-validation, bootstrap resampling"
msgstr "**결과 검증**: 교차 검증, 부트스트랩 재표본추출"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:877
msgid ""
"**Interpret cautiously**: Statistical significance ≠ biological significance"
msgstr "**신중하게 해석**: 통계적 유의성 ≠ 생물학적 유의성"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:878
msgid "**Visualize first**: Explore with PCA before formal tests"
msgstr "**먼저 시각화**: 공식 검정 전에 PCA로 탐색"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:881
msgid "Performance Optimization"
msgstr "성능 최적화"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:883
msgid "**Limit 3D polygon count**: Simplify meshes before import"
msgstr "**3D 폴리곤 수 제한**: 가져오기 전에 메시 단순화"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:884
msgid ""
"**Let large photos downscale**: oversized images (longer side > 2560 px) are"
" stored as a smaller working copy automatically, with the original archived;"
" use **Show Original** only when you need full detail"
msgstr ""
"**큰 사진은 축소되도록 두기**: 과도하게 큰 이미지(긴 변 > 2560 px)는 자동으로 더 작은 작업본으로 저장되고 원본은 따로 "
"보관됩니다. 세밀하게 봐야 할 때만 **원본 보기**\\ (Show Original)를 사용하세요"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:887
msgid "**Run analyses on subsets**: test on a small sample first"
msgstr "**하위 집합에서 분석 실행**: 먼저 작은 샘플로 시험해 보세요"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:890
msgid "Common Workflows"
msgstr "일반적인 워크플로우"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:893
msgid "Workflow 1: 2D Morphometric Study"
msgstr "워크플로우 1: 2D 형태계측 연구"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:909
msgid "Workflow 2: 3D Morphometric Study"
msgstr "워크플로우 2: 3D 형태계측 연구"

