msgstr "**오류**: ``CVA requires at least 2 groups``"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/user_guide.rst:945
msgid "**Solution**: Define a grouping variable with multiple values"
msgstr "**해결책**: 여러 값을 가진 그룹화 변수 정의"

